#ASSERT `Does the Act apply to my injury as a workplace injury` `as the injured person` `as a worker, with a motor vehicle` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS no
-- the baseline's answer on the same facts (s 5 does not apply to the struck worker's accident)
#ASSERT `Does the Act apply to my injury as a workplace injury` `as the injured person` `as a worker, with a motor vehicle` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `yes if` (`Does the Act apply to my workplace injury` `a work injury with liability accepted` `the worker struck by a negligent driver`)
-- the baseline's answer on facts where s 5 applies
#ASSERT `Does the Act apply to my injury as a workplace injury` `as the injured person` `as a worker, with a motor vehicle` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS `yes if` (`Does the Act apply to my workplace injury` `a work injury with liability accepted` `Chloe alone on a WA road`)
#ASSERT `Does the Act apply to my injury as a workplace injury` `as the injured person` `a motor vehicle, not as a worker` `an unasked fact` `an unasked fact` `an unasked fact` `an unasked fact` `an unasked fact` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
