#ASSERT `Can the Commission change the conditions of my registration, or revoke it` `as the carer` `an unasked fact` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
-- s 20(2)(a), (5)
#ASSERT `Can the regulations cap what the Commission pays on my fee` `as the provider` `medical treatment` FALSE EQUALS yes
-- at a public hospital, the fee payable to the hospital: s 20(4)
#ASSERT `Can the regulations cap what the Commission pays on my fee` `as the provider` `attendant care services` TRUE EQUALS no
-- s 20(3); the public-hospital fact is not asked
#ASSERT `Can the regulations cap what the Commission pays on my fee` `as the provider` `treatment at a private hospital, for a fee payable to the hospital` `an unasked fact` EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `Can the regulations cap what the Commission pays on my fee` `as the provider` `another kind of treatment, care or support` `an unasked fact` EQUALS no
#ASSERT `Can the regulations cap what the Commission pays on my fee` `as the injured person` `an unasked kind of service` `an unasked fact` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
#ASSERT `Can the regulations cap what the Commission pays on my fee` `as the carer` `an unasked kind of service` `an unasked fact` EQUALS `does not arise for you`

§§ `Everyone: ss 31, 32`

-- s 31(1)
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for giving the Commission false or misleading information` `as the injured person` EQUALS amount 10000
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for giving the Commission false or misleading information` `as the carer` EQUALS amount 10000
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for giving the Commission false or misleading information` `as the provider` EQUALS amount 10000
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for giving the Commission false or misleading information` `as the injured person` EQUALS amount `What is the most I can be fined for false or misleading information`
-- s 32(2)
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for obstructing a Commission officer` `as the injured person` EQUALS amount 10000
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for obstructing a Commission officer` `as the carer` EQUALS amount 10000
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for obstructing a Commission officer` `as the provider` EQUALS amount 10000
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for obstructing a Commission officer` `as the injured person` EQUALS amount `What is the most I can be fined for obstruction`
